  "title": {
    "rendered": "Fish transportation"
  },
  "content": {
    "rendered": "\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://stathis.com.gr/en/truck-refrigerators/\">Back</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>The transport of fish and shellfish requires:</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Leak-proof, basin-shaped floors in order to prevent the leakage of saltwater into the insulation, which would ruin the insulation.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Holes at the floor corners to aid drainage of effluents</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Stainless-steel cisterns for the collection of effluents.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Optionally there can be placed:</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Stainless drainage channel on the back of the chamber and on the sides.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Stainless steel ladders, wings, toolboxes, etc. to avoid corrosion problems.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-4 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"900\" height=\"675\" data-id=\"1400\" data-src=\"https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stathis-refrig-fish_0029.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1400 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stathis-refrig-fish_0029.jpg 900w, https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stathis-refrig-fish_0029-300x225.jpg 300w, https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stathis-refrig-fish_0029-768x576.jpg 768w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 900px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 900/675;\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"900\" height=\"675\" data-id=\"1403\" data-src=\"https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stathis-refrig-fish_0031.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1403 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stathis-refrig-fish_0031.jpg 900w, https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stathis-refrig-fish_0031-300x225.jpg 300w, https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stathis-refrig-fish_0031-768x576.jpg 768w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 900px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 900/675;\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"900\" height=\"675\" data-id=\"1401\" data-src=\"https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stathis-refrig-fish_0061.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1401 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stathis-refrig-fish_0061.jpg 900w, https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stathis-refrig-fish_0061-300x225.jpg 300w, https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stathis-refrig-fish_0061-768x576.jpg 768w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 900px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 900/675;\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"900\" height=\"675\" data-id=\"1399\" data-src=\"https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stathis-refrig-fish_0298.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1399 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stathis-refrig-fish_0298.jpg 900w, https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stathis-refrig-fish_0298-300x225.jpg 300w, https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stathis-refrig-fish_0298-768x576.jpg 768w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 900px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 900/675;\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"900\" height=\"675\" data-id=\"1402\" data-src=\"https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stathis-refrig-fish_0303.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1402 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stathis-refrig-fish_0303.jpg 900w, https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stathis-refrig-fish_0303-300x225.jpg 300w, https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/stathis-refrig-fish_0303-768x576.jpg 768w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 900px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 900/675;\" /></figure>\n</figure>\n",
